Order a standard laptop from the service catalog

 Concretely, you need to complete the following steps:
1. Navigate to the \PYGZdq{}Service Catalog\PYGZdq{} module of the \PYGZdq{}Self\PYGZhy{}Service\PYGZdq{} application.
2. Go to the hardware store and order 6 \PYGZdq{}Standard Laptop\PYGZdq{} with configuration \PYGZob{}\PYGZsq{}Additional software requirements\PYGZsq{}: \PYGZsq{}Salesforce, Microsoft Office 365, Asana, HubSpot\PYGZsq{}, \PYGZsq{}Adobe Acrobat\PYGZsq{}: True, \PYGZsq{}Adobe Photoshop\PYGZsq{}: True\PYGZcb{}
